    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified FLARE + TARG coordinator for TT-core-backed RAG sessions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Composes one <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_flare_retrieval" kindref="compound">FlareRetrieval</ref></computeroutput> and one <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_t_a_r_g_retrieval" kindref="compound">TARGRetrieval</ref></computeroutput> instance under a single per-token API. Both gates are evaluated independently on every call to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_tensor_r_a_g_pipeline_1a89b8faaf9b47c97134944ff8e251d2d3" kindref="member">step()</ref></computeroutput>; retrieval is recommended when either gate fires. </para>
